"""PDF82 printed 155–156: 5.1.3 advantages i–iv, 5.1.4 disadvantages, 5.1.5 parameter/statistic/estimator, 5.1.6 sampling and non-sampling errors, 5.1.7 bias, 5.1.8 sampling with replacement."""
